flowchart LR
  Forms[String / keyword / UUID] --> Id[Alpha Id]
  Integer[Katamorph PortableInteger] --> Id
  Id --> Artifact[Artifact id]
  Id --> Event[Event id]
  Id --> Ref[Ref id / revision]
  Unsafe[Integer outside safe range] -->|rejected| Finding[Structural finding]
  Double[Noninteger / double number] -->|rejected| Finding
  Id --> Runtime[Exact CLJ / CLJS identity]
